 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : CBACT02C.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS Batch PL/I Program (BMP)                        */
 /* Function    : Card Data Refresh - Load card master                */
 /* Converted from COBOL batch: app/cbl/CBACT02C.cbl                 */
 /*********************************************************************/
